/*
 * Declares the NoneType class.
 *
 * The none type class, is close to the error class but is allowed to exist
 * during YIL export. It will carry the information that the value has no real
 * type, and must be ignored. It is also used as placeholders in temporary
 * types.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::type::native::scalar::none_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/type/native/scalar/none_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
